            "text_aEfNYM": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Warning: Niacin flush</strong></p><p>Some people experience a warm, flushed sensation and temporary skin redness shortly after taking EZ-A. This is a niacin flush, a well-documented response to Vitamin B3. It is harmless, non-allergenic, and typically fades within 20-30 minutes. Taking EZ-A with food minimizes it significantly for most people.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "normal",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "rte",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "1rem",
